  "citation": "Takahashi T; Goddard J G; Rubin S; Chipman D; Sutherland S; Goyet C (1996): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained in the Central South Pacific Ocean (WOCE Sections P17S and P16S) During the TUNES-2 Expedition of the R/V Thomas Washington, July-August, 1991. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP054",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
    "@type": "Dataset",
